  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">In order to support multi-connection capability, new functions are required in the user equipment (UE) and network, such as connection management and coordination, QoS policy control, and access network selection. Recommendation Y.2251 describes the requirements to support multi-connection.</abstract>
